    "details": {
      "alignment": "Unaligned",
      "type": {
        "value": "construct",
        "subtype": "drone"
      },
      "cr": 0.5,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Iron Cordon Brigade packet sheet \u2014 Syringe Carrier Drone.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/iron-legion.json</code> (entry <code>syringe-carrier-drone</code>): Small construct (drone), Unaligned; CR 1/2 (proficiency +2, to hit +4 with DEX); AC 14 (riveted chassis), hit points 18 (4d6+4), speed 35 ft., climb 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Iron Cordon Brigade article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>A clockwork quadrupedal or hexapedal carrier that scuttles under barbed wire and through collapsed mud bunkers to resupply legion chirurgeons and revive fallen frontline soldiers.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> field support \u00b7 <strong>tier:</strong> Skitter-Bot \u00b7 <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Surveillance & Recon.</p><h3>Art</h3><p><strong>Awaiting its plate.</strong> The render <code>npc-forge/iron-legion/renders/syringe-carrier-drone.png</code> has not been cut yet; run the NPC Forge (or <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py plates iron-legion</code>) and rebuild. Seed 510008. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, cold iron and gunmetal grey armor, brass gears, glowing cyan star-bit conduits, flat colours, crisp shading. A low-slung, six-legged mechanical clockwork spider made of dark iron with a large glass bulb on its back filled with luminescent green liquid. It has a gleaming steel syringe arm extended forward. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      }
